00:09:26.866 --> 00:09:28.134
On top of that,

00:09:28.134 --> 00:09:29.101
he has also bragged

00:09:29.101 --> 00:09:30.336
about Wagner deployments

00:09:30.336 --> 00:09:31.938
in Africa, where,

00:09:31.938 --> 00:09:32.905
for example, in Mali,

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:33.873
they have attempted

00:09:33.873 --> 00:09:34.774
to push out the French

00:09:34.774 --> 00:09:36.442
or in Syria where they openly challenged

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:38.277
the United States in combat.

00:09:38.277 --> 00:09:39.111
Now, increasingly,

00:09:39.111 --> 00:09:39.679
by pushing out

00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:40.613
is becoming much more

00:09:40.613 --> 00:09:42.982
than just a kleptocratic oligarch,

00:09:42.982 --> 00:09:43.516
if you will.

00:09:43.516 --> 00:09:44.517
He is now becoming

00:09:44.517 --> 00:09:45.818
a political military figure

00:09:45.818 --> 00:09:47.820
and clearly is aiming

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.156
at the power structure in Moscow.

00:09:50.156 --> 00:09:50.823
And I'd say he's doing that

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:51.557
in two respects.

00:09:51.557 --> 00:09:53.359
One, through these open comments,

00:09:53.359 --> 00:09:53.659
which he's

00:09:53.659 --> 00:09:55.161
taking in a second, through slickly

00:09:55.161 --> 00:09:57.897
produced videos that the Concord Group,

00:09:57.897 --> 00:09:58.998
which is his public relations

00:09:58.998 --> 00:10:00.700
outfit, has been releasing of him

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.168
visiting the front lines,

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:03.269
cutting a strong figure,

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:04.003
leading his troops,

00:10:04.003 --> 00:10:05.504
so to speak, towards combat.

00:10:05.504 --> 00:10:05.972
All of that,

00:10:05.972 --> 00:10:07.440
I think, suggests a transformation

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.442
and a real move towards power in Moscow.

00:10:09.442 --> 00:10:09.709
Well, it's

00:10:09.709 --> 00:10:10.509
significant when you talk

00:10:10.509 --> 00:10:11.544
about the business interests.

00:10:11.544 --> 00:10:12.778
He's got his own PR group.

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:13.245
All of this is

00:10:13.245 --> 00:10:14.146
this is just a person

00:10:14.146 --> 00:10:15.214
who has some mercenaries

00:10:15.214 --> 00:10:16.882
running around that he gets from prisons.

00:10:16.882 --> 00:10:17.883
It is important for people

00:10:17.883 --> 00:10:18.484
to understand the

00:10:18.484 --> 00:10:19.785
context and the depth here.

